 ploads/organization/MayDay26-Mobiize-1200x630_20260331211231467219.png
DESCRIPTION:Join the Pájaros on the streets! On the frontline of economic
 \, political and climate crisis farmworkers have made the choice to STAND 
 UP and FIGHT BACK! This MAY DAY\, farmworkers are leading the way through 
 el pueblo calling on the community to join the fight\, organize\, and leve
 rage worker power! The March will start at Southwest Park and end at Julli
 ard Park. La Unión Hace La Fuerza! https://www.nbclc.org/event-details-re
 gistration/may-day-worker-power-march
LOCATION:Southwest Community Park\, 1698 Hearn Ave\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 954
 07
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/aflcio/event/936646/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
