 appetizers. Music provided by Memory Lane Combo. Limited seating\, RSVP an
 d donate early! Suggested donation: $50-$85 per person at https://bit.ly/S
 teph_Wine. Silent auction items include vacation stays in San Francisco\, 
LOCATION:Forestville\, CA
